    <Requirement id="ER-P020-03" level="1" requirementType="commissioning_check">
      <sysml:Name>温控调节验证</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水系统调试时应验证温度控制阀在全负荷范围内的自动调节功能，并确认手动备用模式可用。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P020" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-CTRL-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-DNV-COOL-003" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-COMM-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>温控失效可能导致主机冷却水温度异常，影响燃烧效率和部件寿命。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查调试记录，确认温控阀在主机各负荷下能自动调节冷却水温度至设定范围。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>验证手动备用模式可正常操作，具体温度设定值按主机厂家 Technical Data 确认。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【温控调节验证】，来自原始需求「温控调节」。E-CTRL-COOL-001（IACS UR E10）支撑了温控系统全负荷自动调节和手动备用要求；E-DNV-COOL-003（DNV规则）支撑了温控阀全范围动作验证；E-COMM-COOL-001（综合规范程序）支撑了温控阀功能验证步骤。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
