    <Requirement id="ER-P020-04" level="1" requirementType="commissioning_check">
      <sysml:Name>报警与参数响应验证</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水系统调试时应验证高温报警、低液位报警等报警功能，并确认主要冷却用户（如主机、发电机等）的冷却水参数响应正常。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P020" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-CCS-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-COMM-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-IACS-M51-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-DNV-COOL-003" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>报警失效或参数异常未及时发现可能导致设备损坏或安全事故。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查调试记录，确认所有冷却水系统报警（高温、低液位等）均能正确触发，报警值按主机厂家 Technical Data 确认。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>确认主要冷却用户（主机、发电机等）的冷却水进出口温度、压力等参数在调试期间记录完整且响应正常。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【报警与参数响应验证】，来自原始需求「报警触发和主要冷却用户参数响应」。E-CCS-COOL-002（CCS规则）支撑了报警功能试验；E-COMM-COOL-001（综合规范程序）支撑了高温报警和低液位报警验证；E-IACS-M51-001（IACS UR M51）支撑了报警和跳闸功能验证；E-DNV-COOL-003（DNV规则）支撑了高温报警和监测仪表指示验证。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
